VERDICT: The three renderings agree on the design work and the joins mostly land, but the algorithm does not hold together as a run definition: the two things that terminate a run — the baseline and the final "what is missing" pass — have no owner, one whole class of task has no stop condition at all, and the skill has already grown a required pre-run gate and a design-evidence rule that the method and the diagram do not contain.
